nuclei
Usage: nuclei -u URL [-silent] [-tags ...] [-severity ...]

Template-driven scanner. It runs a large library of community checks for known
CVEs, misconfigurations and exposures against a target, and reports what
matched. Point it at the urls httpx said were live.

	-u URL             scan a single target ( -l FILE for a list )
	-tags cve,exposure  limit to these template tags
	-severity high,critical   only report findings this serious
	-silent            just the findings, no banner

Only against hosts you own or are authorised to test. In this school the
target is always `127.0.0.1`.

See also: httpx, ffuf, sqlmap
